      "caption": "Figure 2 : Overall framework of LookasideVLN. The agent queries the Spatial Landmark Knowledge Base to construct an Egocentric Lookaside Graph, which is then converted into instruction-like, direction-aware path descriptions. A Lookaside MLLM agent selects the final path based on the alignment among the directional path, instruction snippet, and current observation.",
