      "caption": "Figure 2 : Overall OmniRet architecture. Our universal retrieval model integrates specialized visual and audio encoders with a Large Language Model acting as a cross-modal composer. Media inputs are processed through a Shared Media Resampler, and the final embedding is derived via our Attention Sliced Wasserstein Pooling. The model is optimized using Contrastive, Triplet and Diversity losses.",
