  {
    "id": "cvpr26-31a5d996d652",
    "extraction": {
      "figure": "Figure 2",
      "caption": "Figure 2 : Framework of ChangeBridge. It includes three main modules: a) Composed bridge initialization: builds a cross-spatiotemporal diffusion bridge from a composed input, combining the pre-event background with the control-driven foreground. b) Asynchronous drift diffusion: introduces a pixel-wise drift map to assign different drift magnitudes to the foreground and background regions, enabling differentiated evolution. c) Drift-aware denoising: embeds the drift distribution into the denoising network to guide drift-aware reconstruction. Multimodal controls (e.g., coordinate text, semantic mask, and instance layout) are supported.",
      "image_url": "https://arxiv.org/html/2507.04678v3/method1.png",
      "figureAnchor": "S2.F2",
      "panelIndex": 0,
