      "figure": "Figure 2",
      "caption": "Figure 2. Overview of ELF-VLA. First, the model is pre-trained on an autonomous driving Q&A dataset to provide it with foundational driving knowledge. Subsequently, it undergoes SFT on a mixed dataset of “Base Inputs” and “Feedback Inputs”, enabling it to learn trajectory prediction and feedback-based refinement simultaneously. Finally, in the RL phase, a teacher model is used to generate feedback, thereby reducing the proportion of zero-reward rollouts.",
