      "id": "cvpr26-14a19cd61f21",
      "figure": "Figure 2",
      "caption": "Figure 2. Framework of our DMGD method. Our method establishes two guidance modules during the sampling process: semantic matching and distribution matching. In semantic matching, we propose a dynamic soft label mechanism to unlock the potential of diffusion models for diversified generation while ensuring semantic alignment. In distribution matching, we optimize optimal transport computation through distribution approximation and greedy progressive matching to enable optimal transport-based distribution alignment guidance. We present the corresponding pseudocode in the Appendix A3 Algorithm 1.",
