    "id": "cvpr26-20b27f0954d8",
    "extraction": {
      "figure": "Figure 2",
      "caption": "Figure 2 : Overview of our framework.\n(a) The supervision enhancement framework produces enhanced ground truth images by fusing frequency components from the original ground truth I 0 GT I_{0}^{\\text{GT}} and its super-resolved variants I i GT I^{\\text{GT}}_{i} using adaptive frequency masks M i M_{i} .\n(b) The conditional frequency mask generator constructs M i M_{i} by combining predefined masks R b R_{b} weighted with predicted coefficients c i , b c_{i,b} , followed by a softmax function.\n(c) The output refinement network (ORNet) is trained with this enhanced supervision to improve perceptual quality.",
      "image_url": "https://arxiv.org/html/2512.03932v3/overview.png",
      "figureAnchor": "S3.F2",
      "panelIndex": 0,
      "panelCount": 1,
      "score": 48,
