      "caption": "Figure 2 : Overall pipeline of BrepGaussian .\nGiven multi-view RGB images of a CAD object, we extract edge and patch views using existing edge detection and segmentation models.\nThese views drive a two-stage Gaussian Splatting model that\npredicts edge and patch labels on the reconstructed point cloud.\nThe fitted primitives are globally optimized to obtain the final B-Rep model.",
