      "caption": "Figure 1 : Overview of our proposed CogniVerse. The framework begins with a Cognitive Reflection Module to assess retrieval necessity, followed by a Multi-modal Retrieval Module that aligns embeddings in a Riemannian manifold and refines knowledge graphs using spectral methods. Finally, a Hierarchical Generation Module produces coherent answers using an optimal transport-based loss. Best viewed in color.",
