      "caption": "Figure 2. Model architecture and training of RLVC. The top panel shows how we train the reward model with a visual encoder to produce fine-tuned visual features and reward signals. The bottom panel depicts how we update the policy model Gθ (i.e., generator) via outcome- reward reinforcement learning (blue arrows) and visual cues (green arrows), enabling synthesized features that remain task-relevant and faithfully represent the data distribution. x0 and ˜x0 denote the real and synthesized features of seen classes, respectively.",
