      "caption": "Figure 2 : (a) Overall MambaLiteUNet pipeline. (b) Mamba block: Integrate SS2D [ 19 ] , leveraging SSM [ 12 ] to process 2D visual data. (c) AMF: Merge parallel Mamba branches via learnable dual adaptive gating S S and T T . (d) LGFM: Fuse local features (depthwise convolutions) with global context (multi-head attention). (e) CGA: Enhance skip connections using encoder-decoder features.",
